Package: shootingvictimspipeline
Title: Philadelphia Shooting Victims Data Pipeline
Version: 0.0.1
Description: Pulls ACS Census data and Philadelphia open data sources, spatially joins shooting victim records to geographic boundaries, and writes a processed CSV for the dashboard.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    sf,
    tidycensus,
    readr
Encoding: UTF-8
